Altair's GoPro mount library (the male and female quick-release connectors and
the M5 screw handle) with two of the upstream samples: the extension arm and
the phone holder, plus the upstream LICENSE. Copied verbatim from the pinned
commit, keeping upstream's Samples/ layout so each sample's
`include <../GoPro.scad>` still resolves. The screw-handle sample, the samples
that need the separate A2D library, the STL exports, the workspace file and the
code of conduct are not vendored. The screw handle is exposed as a catalog
object through a wrapper around gopro_screw_handle().

